    "regime_notes": "Positive 10d IC in 2020-2022 (+0.052040), 2023-2024 (+0.026640), 2025-2026 (+0.047312), 2029 partial (+0.028226); negative in 2027-2028 (-0.012152), so regime dependence remains material. Small 15-asset cross-section requires conservative interpretation.",
